* pattern_bt -- matches an alternation that must backtrack before the winning arm commits, 1000 times.
* bottleneck: alternation backtracking; capture on the winning arm.
        pat = ('aaa' | 'bbb' | 'ccc' | 'ddd') SPAN('abcd') . tail
        subject = 'xxxxxxxxxxbbbccccddddaaaaxxxxxxxxxxbbbccccddddaaaa'
        i = 1
loop    subject ? pat
        i = LT(i, 1000) i + 1                           :S(loop)
        OUTPUT = 'captured tail = ' tail
END
